Package: com.albrhi.panel
Name: Albrhi Panel (rootless)
Version: 0.9.38
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Albrhi's settings, in the iOS Settings app.
 .
 Adds an Albrhi page to Settings listing every app Albrhi patches, with a switch for
 each one. Turn it off for an app and Albrhi does nothing inside that app — without
 uninstalling anything, and with your settings kept for when you turn it back on.
 .
 Close and reopen the app for a change to take effect.
 .
 The list comes from the tweaks actually installed, so a new Albrhi tweak appears
 here on its own.
 .
 Arabic and English.
 .
 Developed by Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn. Open source under the GNU GPL v3.
Homepage: https://github.com/ibrahim2100/albrhi-repo
Maintainer: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn <ibrahimalrahan01@gmail.com>
Author: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn
Section: Tweaks
Icon: https://ibrahim2100.github.io/albrhi-repo/CydiaIcon.png
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Conflicts: com.albrhi.panel.roothide
Replaces: com.albrhi.panel.roothide
